# macOS Finder metadata — never content
.DS_Store

# Derived caches. `build_state()` rewrites every one of these from the v{N}/
# sources on EVERY run, so tracking them makes each diff carry that noise.
# Verified regenerable byte-for-byte. Everything else under `_state/` IS tracked
# — `approvals/`, `gate-pass-*`, `analyze-*`, `briefs/` — because nothing can
# rebuild those.
**/_state/current-*.md
**/_state/traceability.md
**/_state/state.json

# Implementer receipts — per-run, not governance
**/modules/*/**/receipts/
